{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":15.08},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":15.76,"end":27.36},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":29.12,"end":39.12}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":3.12,"text":"線性插值在相同時間走相同距離。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":3.6,"end":6.96,"text":"彈跳通常在頂端變慢、朝地面加速。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":7.6,"end":10.72,"text":"緩動重新分配時間中的移動量，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":10.88,"end":15.08,"text":"但風格化曲線不一定是完整物理模擬。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":15.76,"end":17.76,"text":"固定週期比較緩動模式，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":18.08,"end":21.48,"text":"在頂端和地面附近拖動時間軸，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":21.68,"end":24.16,"text":"檢查哪裡位置變化最快。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":26,"end":27.36,"text":"緩動主要改變什麼？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":29.12,"end":30.64,"text":"緩動主要改變什麼？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":32.16,"end":35.92,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":36.56,"end":39.12,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}